# The rendezvous and relay this copy of the game points at.
#
# Copy this file to config/relay.txt and put your own address in the copy.
# Without a relay.txt the game still plays over a local network; what it
# loses is "rooms on the internet", which is what the relay carries.
#
# One address, "host" or "host:port". Without a port it means 34720.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# This is only a default. A player who types something into the Server box
# keeps their own choice, and GT2_RELAY overrides both.
#
# GT2Relay/DEPLOY-TUNNEL.md sets one of these up over a free UDP tunnel, and
# GT2Relay/DEPLOY-GCP.md on a machine with an address of its own.
relay.example.com:34720
